For setting up in linux
    1. Run setup.sh in the project root directory:
    2. chmod +x setup.sh
    3. ./setup.sh

For setting up in windows
    1. Install MSYS2 → https://www.msys2.org/
    2. Open "MSYS2 MinGW64"
    3. Run:
    pacman -S mingw-w64-x86_64-gcc mingw-w64-x86_64-cmake mingw-w64-x86_64-openssl mingw-w64-x86_64-nlohmann-json
    4. Build:
    mkdir build && cd build
    cmake .. -G "MinGW Makefiles"
    mingw32-make